# Play test of Castaway Knoll (CIPlay castaway_knoll, in a test world 'CI ...'): a sunken island, 11 m under the sea. No
# quest: the lost raft in the kelp, her crate and chest. Points as in its recipe (heights over the island's own water line).
island Castaway Knoll
offset 0 0
expect animals Turtle 1
wait 3
at -2.6 -0.5 h=6
open The lost raft's crate
at 2.2 5.2 h=6
open The castaway's chest
